    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0080",
      "reading_order": 92,
      "section": "Purpose",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 744.6660195312501,
        "r": 560.2230000000001,
        "b": 724.3383344167462
      },
      "content": "This chapter provides you with all the information you need in order to work with the microwave combination oven safely without putting yourself or others at risk.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0081",
      "reading_order": 93,
      "section": "Purpose",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.008999999999986,
        "t": 719.9430195312501,
        "r": 385.02000000000004,
        "b": 711.7557304760583
      },
      "content": "This is a particularly important chapter that you must read through carefully.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_0082",
      "reading_order": 94,
      "severity": "important",
      "content": "IMPORTANT: This manual provides technical guidance for technicians who have successfully undertaken a recognized product familiarization and training course run by Merrychef to carry out service/repair tasks to the appliance/s shown on the front cover of this manual which must not be used for any other make or model of appliance.",
      "section": "IMPORTANT:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 697.3860195312501,
        "r": 95.10300000000001,
        "b": 689.1987304760582
      },
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "admonition",
      "semantic_role": "important",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0084",
      "reading_order": 96,
      "section": "IMPORTANT:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.027000000000044,
        "t": 648.5520195312502,
        "r": 560.2500000000001,
        "b": 628.2243344167463
      },
      "content": "Please remember that it is wiser not to attempt a service task if you are unsure of being able to complete it competently, quickly, and above all safely.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0085",
      "reading_order": 97,
      "section": "IMPORTANT:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.01800000000003,
        "t": 624.0720195312501,
        "r": 560.4741,
        "b": 603.6273344167463
      },
      "content": "To avoid injury to yourself or others and to protect the appliance from possible damage, ensure you have read and understand all the relevant instructions and ALWAYS follow the safety codes when servicing an oven.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0086",
      "reading_order": 98,
      "section": "IMPORTANT:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 50.40900000000005,
        "t": 599.2320195312502,
        "r": 483.5610000000001,
        "b": 591.0447304760584
      },
      "content": "Ensure the electrical supply is locked-off to prevent the oven from being inadvertently powered up.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0087",
      "reading_order": 99,
      "section": "IMPORTANT:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 50.41800000000012,
        "t": 587.2350195312503,
        "r": 560.4750000000001,
        "b": 566.9073344167464
      },
      "content": "Do not leave the oven unattended without the oven panels fitted and keep within sight of other personnel when testing the oven, ensuring persons other than trained engineers are denied access.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0088",
      "reading_order": 100,
      "section": "IMPORTANT:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 50.40000000000009,
        "t": 562.7550195312502,
        "r": 560.4570000000001,
        "b": 542.4273344167464
      },
      "content": "The minimum number of panels should be removed, and the high voltage capacitors must be discharged before working on the oven using a suitable capacitor discharge tool (see section 2.15).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0089",
      "reading_order": 101,
      "section": "IMPORTANT:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 50.409000000000106,
        "t": 538.0320195312503,
        "r": 469.629,
        "b": 529.8447304760584
      },
      "content": "Temporary insulation should be used to prevent accidental contact with dangerous conductors.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0090",
      "reading_order": 102,
      "section": "IMPORTANT:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 50.40900000000005,
        "t": 526.0350195312503,
        "r": 558.801,
        "b": 505.5903344167465
      },
      "content": "Do not touch any internal wiring or connectors within the oven, whether you believe it is live or not and avoid touching the metalwork (casing, panels, etc) of the oven with your body.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0091",
      "reading_order": 103,
      "section": "IMPORTANT:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 50.400000000000034,
        "t": 501.1860195312503,
        "r": 497.3490000000001,
        "b": 492.99873047605854
      },
      "content": "Only use electrically rated screwdrivers for adjusting 'pots' etc., ensuring the tool touches nothing else.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0092",
      "reading_order": 104,
      "section": "IMPORTANT:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 50.40900000000016,
        "t": 488.94601953125,
        "r": 293.8410000000002,
        "b": 480.75873047605825
      },
      "content": "Ensure the test equipment is set correctly before use.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0093",
      "reading_order": 105,
      "section": "IMPORTANT:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 50.418000000000205,
        "t": 476.94901953125,
        "r": 558.5220000000003,
        "b": 456.62133441674615
      },
      "content": "Test equipment such as meter test leads or clamps must be fitted and removed whilst the unit is dead, for each and every test.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0094",
      "reading_order": 106,
      "section": "IMPORTANT:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 50.38200000000024,
        "t": 452.22601953124996,
        "r": 432.16200000000015,
        "b": 444.0387304760582
      },
      "content": "Do not undertake functional magnetron testing with the panels of the casing removed.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0095",
      "reading_order": 107,
      "section": "IMPORTANT:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 50.38200000000023,
        "t": 440.22901953124995,
        "r": 366.89400000000023,
        "b": 432.0417304760582
      },
      "content": "Avoid touching the test equipment, unless necessary for the operation.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
        }
      ],
      "page": 7,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0096",
      "reading_order": 108,
      "section": "IMPORTANT:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 50.391000000000304,
        "t": 427.98901953124994,
        "r": 555.0714000000003,
        "b": 407.6613344167461
      },
      "content": "Upon completion of a service follow the steps for commissioning the oven under the 'Commissioning the appliance' section of this manual.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_91",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_91",
          "title": "Purpose"
