    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0099",
      "reading_order": 111,
      "section": "Object of the safety code",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 35.98799999999994,
        "t": 344.34601953125,
        "r": 560.5829999999999,
        "b": 299.53833441674624
      },
      "content": "This safety code aims to ensure that all persons who operate, install, service and repair the microwave combination oven have a thorough knowledge of the hazards and safety precautions, and that they follow the warning notices given in the conneX ® Installation  and  User  manual,  this  Service  manual  and  on  the  appliance.  If  you  do  not  follow  this  safety  code,  you  risk potentially fatal injury and property damage.",
